{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Style rules for indentation, blank lines, braces, casting, assignment spacing, and relying on built-in word wrap for width.","label":"Coding style","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/coding_conventions","label":"Coding conventions","url":"\/computer\/programming\/coding_conventions"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/command_line_interface_description_language","label":"CLI description language","url":"\/computer\/programming\/command_line_interface_description_language"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tStyle rules for indentation, blank lines, braces, casting, assignment spacing, and relying on built-in word wrap for width.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Indentation.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Blank line.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Braces<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>A code block visible in a page should stay visible as a block.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>A lengthy block should have separate starting parentheses.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>The ending brace should be dedicated.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Casting<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSpace after casting.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Equals (assignment)<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSeparated by space.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Width<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRely on in-built word wrap, as this will be dynamic based on client window size.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/coding_style\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/coding_style\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/coding_conventions' data-target='computer\/programming\/coding_conventions' data-title='Coding conventions' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Coding conventions<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/command_line_interface_description_language' data-target='computer\/programming\/command_line_interface_description_language' data-title='CLI description language' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>CLI description language<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming.jpg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><